# Story page: maw
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Maw
---
At the very top of the sky there was a mouth, and it was open.

The Maw had swallowed every island's troubles and kept them: bombs, ghosts, lightning, spikes, and the Hunter, curled patiently in the dark. The ground itself opened and closed beneath {name} like a jaw, chewing.

In the deepest part of it ticked a little green clock, and every tick was worth twice as much as the last. {name} understood, then, that it was being tested. I understood that I had been tested too, and had not studied.
